+`19` descendable, `12` anchor-zero, `0` undefined after drop, residue
+`1/20`.  `s_eff=2` on `29/57` and `12/19` is confirmed.  Exact all-row
+`s_eff=3` at `n<=100` is `27/57`, not `14/57`; `14` is the anchor-zero
